      "side": 1,
      "message": "No it wouldn\u0027t defeat the sense of slices: we have one thread per slice and this remains the same. The fields you mention are used to avoid submitting the same change twice for (async) reindexing. `AllChangesIndexer` doesn\u0027t use async reindexing methods of the `ChangeIndexer` and even if it would there would be nothing bad if only one instance of the `ChangeIndexer` would be used.",
